    "codeLanguage": "html",
    "title": "Adding Images",
    "descriptionContent": "Learn how to edit images with attributes and how to add them to your webpage with URLs.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17112,
        "title": "Images",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>HTML also allows us to add images to a game HUD.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   img {&#xA;    border: solid gray 10px;&#xA;    margin: 10px;&#xA;    padding: 5px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    width: 260px;&#xA;    margin: auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Level Complete Badge&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;width: 200px;&quot; src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144765,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To add <strong>sprites</strong> to a game UI, we start with the <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> tag.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;a&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144766,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Just like <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> is an <strong>empty tag</strong>. That means it has no closing tag.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;img&gt;&lt;/img&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code>, followed by <code>img</code>, and finally <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To display a sprite, an image tag needs the <code>src</code> attribute. <code>src</code> stands for source.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"source\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We set the sprite we want to display with an <code>=</code> sign and the image address between double quotes.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"source\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>src</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can use attributes to change the size of sprites. The <code>width</code> and <code>height</code> attributes use pixels as the default unit of measurement.</p><p>For example, to set the width of this sprite to 100px, code <code>width = \"100\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;100&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>width</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"100\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>And the <code>height</code> attribute adjusts the <strong>height</strong> of a sprite.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"59\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>height</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 144771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What makes <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> an empty tag?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It has no closing tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It has no attributes</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">There's no <code>/</code> in its opening tag</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It has no closing tag.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 144772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How many sprites will appear on this game HUD?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/star.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick 2.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 144773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How can we adjust the height of a sprite?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">With the <code>height</code> attribute</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">With the <code>&lt;height&gt;</code> tag</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">With the <code>height</code> attribute.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 144774,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which attribute do we need to set for the <code>img</code> tag?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>src</code> attribute</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>href</code> attribute</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>src</code> attribute.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 144775,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set the <code>width</code> attribute of the sprite to <code>\"200\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;width&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/star.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>width</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"200\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 144776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pick the correct tag for a sprite image.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/sword.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/img&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;img</code> followed by <code>src=</code> and then <code>\"https://mimo.app/i/sword.png\"</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 144777,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use the correct attribute to set the source of the sprite.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"8\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 144778,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the height of the sprite with <code>height=\"100\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/star.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>height=\"100\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
